oneOf.description:
Angle between two lines, in RADIANS. (`SketchConstraint::Angle`;
note that constraint's *expression* evaluates in degrees — the
conversion is the UI's, as everywhere else here.)

frame.description:
The frame when there is no `geom_ref` (meters, part coordinates;
default: the part origin, z up). With a `geom_ref`, a non-zero
`x_axis` is the secondary direction.
